                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Solid gameplay, top down shooter experience.\nGreat sound effects, excellent blood splatter, satisfying combat.\nCheck it out!\nThe game is really fun and the dev is really passionately working to address all the issues.\nMy original (negative review) is below.\n\n*************************\nThe bits of the game that I got to play were fairly fun.\nUnfortunately, the game crashes when I click on multiplayer mode as well as campaign mode.\nI am sure with some work, this game is going to be a great time eventually, but beware if you are purchasing it now.\nIt needs a lot of work.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/sfLFu_GGGyk",
                        "timestamp_created": 1567777130,
